---
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
{%- comment -%}
  Every HTML page is an index.html, so its URL ends in "/"; that leaves out
  data files such as /activity/rollcalls.json. No <lastmod>: pages carry no
  change dates, and the build time would mark every page changed each hour.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- for p in site.pages -%}
  {%- assign last = p.url | slice: -1 -%}
  {%- if last == "/" and p.sitemap != false %}
  <url><loc>{{ p.url | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</loc></url>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor %}
</urlset>
